# shell: desktop
# A stationary pointer opens a Deskbar submenu without another click.
wait 12
click 980 20
wait 4
move 800 132
wait 35
expect-menu Fonts
expect-menu Devices Preferences
expect-same-as-redraw
note crossing the gap into Settings keeps the submenu open
move 685 132
wait 4
move 500 132
wait 30
expect-menu Fonts
expect-same-as-redraw
note moving to Applications replaces Settings after the hover delay
move 800 153
wait 35
expect-menu TikuReader
expect-same-as-redraw
note moving back needs no click; selecting a child still works
move 800 132
wait 35
expect-menu Fonts
menu-pick Fonts
wait 12
expect-title Fonts
key Escape
wait 4
expect-no-title Fonts
quit
